#: ../../user/recipes/add-openapi-docs.md:97
msgid "Group Routes with Tags"
msgstr "タグでルートをグループ化する"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-openapi-docs.md:99
msgid "Tags control how Scalar UI groups endpoints in the sidebar:"
msgstr ""
"タグは Scalar UI がサイドバーでエンドポイントをどうグループ化するかを"
"制御します:"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-openapi-docs.md:110
msgid "Security"
msgstr "セキュリティ"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-openapi-docs.md:112
msgid "Wire bearer-token auth into the spec:"
msgstr "Bearer トークン認証を仕様に組み込みます:"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-openapi-docs.md:127
msgid ""
"Scalar UI renders an \"Authorize\" button so visitors can paste their "
"token."
msgstr ""
"Scalar UI は \"Authorize\" ボタンを表示し、訪問者がトークンを貼り付け"
"られるようにします。"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-openapi-docs.md:129
msgid "Exporting the Spec"
msgstr "仕様のエクスポート"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-openapi-docs.md:131
msgid ""
"`curl http://localhost:3000/openapi.json > openapi.json` dumps the spec "
"to disk. Wire this into CI to validate that the spec stays stable across "
"commits, or feed it to a client generator (`openapi-generator`, `orval`, "
"`@hey-api/openapi-ts`)."
msgstr ""
"`curl http://localhost:3000/openapi.json > openapi.json` で仕様をディスク"
"に書き出せます。これを CI に組み込んで仕様がコミット間で安定している"
"ことを検証したり、クライアントジェネレータ (`openapi-generator`、`orval`"
"、`@hey-api/openapi-ts`) に渡したりできます。"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-openapi-docs.md:133
msgid "Switching UIs"
msgstr "UI の切り替え"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-openapi-docs.md:135
msgid ""
"Scalar is the default, but the spec at `/openapi.json` works with any "
"OpenAPI renderer:"
msgstr ""
"Scalar がデフォルトですが、`/openapi.json` の仕様は任意の OpenAPI"
" レンダラーで使用できます:"

#: ../../user/recipes/add-openapi-docs.md:137
msgid "[Swagger UI](https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-ui)"
msgstr "[Swagger UI](https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-ui)"

